        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_first_01",
      "hash64": "460FACA24F6D7C8F",
      "text": "Oh, Momentchen! Ich wurde doch bestimmt als\\nArenaleiterin herbestellt, nicht wahr?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "F177A680C0FE80E0",
      "text": "Oh! Du bist es, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "F177A780C0FE8293",
      "text": "Schon seltsam, dass wir uns an einem Ort wie\\ndiesem hier begegnen, nicht?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "702ED4B3FE23108A",
      "text": "Ich habe Sie eingeladen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "702ED3B3FE230ED7",
      "text": "Ja, wirklich seltsam.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "F177A880C0FE8446",
      "text": "Ach ja? Das ist aber süß von dir.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp01_02b",
      "hash64": "4CD776C7F07A892C",
      "text": "Das sagst du jetzt so, aber du wirkst erstaunlich\\ngelassen.\\c\\nKann es vielleicht sein, dass die Einladung von\\ndir stammt?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "F177A980C0FE85F9",
      "text": "Hihi! Dann wäre ja alles geklärt.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "F177AA80C0FE87AC",
      "text": "Wo ich schon einmal als Mentorin hier bin,\\nsollte ich mich auch ordentlich ins Zeug legen.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "F177AB80C0FE895F",
      "text": "Ich werde den Schülern dieser Akademie all die\\nVorzüge von Käfer-Pokémon näherbringen![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "C6F9B08C0A67418F",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Du wirst nicht glauben, was mir passiert ist,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
